# Zenith Agents

## Numbered agents (map to real code)

| Agent | Role | Primary files |
|-------|------|----------------|
| 1 Vision | OCR invoice fields | `agents/ingestion.py`, `core/whatsapp_intake.py` |
| 2 Anomaly | Pre-verify audit + chat panel (SQLite) | `agents/anomaly.py` — math, qty/reorder history, `{findings, chat_messages}` |
| 3 Strategist | Cunning cheque planner (Gemini tool-calling) | `agents/strategist_agent.py` → `agents/bundling_tools.py` → `core/bundling.py`, `core/strategist_dates.py`, `core/guardrails.py` |
| 4 Reviewer | Plain-language strategy explainer (Gemini) | `agents/reviewer.py` — lang-aware teacher tone |

**Guardrails** — Python only: `core/guardrails.py` (runs after Agent 3).

**Fallback bundling math** — `core/bundling.py` (`compute_bundles`) used when strategist fails or `USE_FAKE_AI=true`.

## Agentic layer (`agentic/`)

- Parallel to normal web flows; `USE_AGENTIC_ORCHESTRATOR=false` by default
- Entry: `handle_event()` / `POST /api/orchestrate`
- WhatsApp **photos** still use inbox-v2 even when agentic is on
- Agentic text routing: `agentic/adapters/whatsapp_bridge.py`

## Config flags

- `USE_FAKE_AI=true` — mock OCR/strategist/reviewer (demo)
- `USE_STRATEGIST_TOOL_AGENT=true` — Agent 3 Gemini tool loop (default); fallback one-shot JSON
- `OPENAI_API_KEY` — bundling chat assistant only (not reviewer)
- `ENABLE_VECTOR_PATTERNS` — Chroma at `database/chroma` (`core/vector_store.py`)

## When adding agent behavior

- Reuse `agents/base.py` for Gemini calls (Agents 1, 3, 4)
- Store `audit` + `anomalies` in `pending_dealer_json` for verify UI
- Do not bypass human verify on the standard web path unless explicitly requested
